  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b338b68f951094a44a4addc97d1ad3cd, type: 3}
  questDescription: I am the old apple tree by the mill, and the whole village shakes
    my branches. Lumberjacks keep eyeing my trunk, so I'd like a decent shield against
    them, nothing crazy. I also dream of golden apples, lots and lots of them! And
    no more snapping in the wind, please.
  requirements:
  - type: 5
    tier: 3
  - type: 6
    tier: 2
  - type: 1
    tier: 0
  successText: Golden apples everywhere! And the lumberjacks just walked right past
    me.
  partialText: Hm, I feel a bit different. It will do, I guess.
  failureText: Now my branches are all droopy and the lumberjacks are laughing!
